      "notice": "Three of these you met earlier today — 木, 水 and 火 are the characters you just learned to decode.",
      "discover": "They are not five separate things. Traditional Chinese thought links them in a ring, each one feeding the next, and that ring is called 五行 wǔxíng — the five phases.",
